"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Learning Digital Marketing is Important Today<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here is something worth thinking about. The global digital marketing market was valued at USD 456.7 billion in 2025 and is expected to reach&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.imarcgroup.com\/digital-marketing-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">USD 1,200 billion by 2034<\/a>, growing at a CAGR of&nbsp;nearly 11%. This is not a passing trend. It is a massive industry shift that is only going to grow bigger.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is why learning digital marketing matters right now:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today.webp\" alt=\"Why Learning Digital Marketing is Important Today\" class=\"wp-image-20070\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/why-learning-digital-marketing-is-important-today-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Businesses are Moving Online at a Rapid Pace<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Almost every&nbsp;business, from a small local shop to a large corporation, now needs an online presence. And to manage that presence, they need skilled digital marketers. This has created millions of job opportunities across the globe.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. High Demand, Low Supply of Skilled Professionals<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The demand for digital marketing professionals is growing much faster than the number of people trained to do the job. This means if you learn the right skills, finding work (whether as an employee or a freelancer) becomes much easier.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Digital Marketing Skills Pay Well<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Digital marketing roles are among the better-paying jobs in the online space. Whether you work with a company, take up freelance projects, or start your own agency, there is a clear earning potential. Even entry-level positions come with competitive salaries.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. You Can Work from Anywhere<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the biggest advantages of digital marketing is location independence. Once you have the skills, you can work from home, a cafe, or anywhere else with a decent internet connection. This flexibility is something most traditional careers simply cannot offer.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Every Business Needs It<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Unlike some niche skills that are only useful in specific industries, digital marketing is needed everywhere. E-commerce stores, hospitals, schools, startups, FMCG companies, and even politicians use digital marketing to reach their audience. The applications are endless.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are wondering,&nbsp;can I learn digital marketing at home? The&nbsp;answer is a definite yes. All you need is a device, an internet connection, and the willingness to put in some time every day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Learning Digital Marketing from Home&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Before we get into the how,&nbsp;letting&nbsp;us quickly look at&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/why-learn-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">why learning digital marketing<\/a>&nbsp;from home is actually a smart choice.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home.webp\" alt=\"Benefits of Learning Digital Marketing from Home\" class=\"wp-image-20071\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/benefits-of-learning-digital-marketing-from-home-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Learn at Your Own Pace<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When you learn from home, there is no pressure to keep up with a class. You can rewatch a video, pause and take notes, or revisit a concept as many times as you need. This kind of flexibility leads to&nbsp;much&nbsp;better understanding.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Save Time and Money<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>No commuting. No classroom fees. No fixed schedule. Many of the best digital marketing resources are available for free or at a very affordable price. This makes it accessible to&nbsp;almost everyone, regardless of&nbsp;the financial&nbsp;situation.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Practical Learning Environment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Learning from home means you can practice what you learn right away. You can open a browser, create a test ad account, or start a blog on the same device you are using to study. Theory and practice go hand in hand.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Access to Global Resources<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When you learn from home, you are not limited to what is available locally. You have access to world-class courses, international certifications, expert blogs, and YouTube tutorials created by professionals from across the globe.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Build a Portfolio as You Learn<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the best things about digital marketing is that you can start creating real work while still learning. A practice blog, a test ad campaign, or a social media page you manage can all become part of your portfolio, even before you get your first job or client.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/benefits-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">benefits of digital marketing<\/a>&nbsp;as a career are clear, and home-based learning makes the journey even more practical and affordable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home? (Different Ways)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Now we get to the part you have been waiting for. Here are the best ways to&nbsp;learn digital marketing at home, whether you are a complete beginner or someone who already knows the basics and wants to go deeper.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways.webp\" alt=\"How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home? (Different Ways)\" class=\"wp-image-20072\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-different-ways-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Join an Online Digital Marketing Course<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is&nbsp;arguably the&nbsp;most structured and effective way to learn. A good <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing course<\/a>&nbsp;covers everything in a logical order, from the basics to advanced topics, with assignments, case studies, and projects to help you practice.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>When choosing a course, look for the following:<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>A curriculum that covers SEO, social media, PPC, content marketing, email marketing, and analytics&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Video lectures that you can watch at your own pace&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Practical assignments and real-world projects&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A recognized certificate upon completion&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Access to a community of learners&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Platforms like&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WsCube&nbsp;Tech<\/a> offer&nbsp;well-structured <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing course<\/a>&nbsp;designed for beginners. These courses walk you through the entire field, step by step, without assuming any prior knowledge.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are asking\u00a0how to learn digital marketing at\u00a0home\u00a0free, several platforms do offer free introductory courses. Google&#8217;s\u00a0Skillshop, HubSpot Academy, and Meta Blueprint all provide free learning resources that are quite good for building a foundation.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>However, if you want a comprehensive learning experience with proper mentorship, a paid course is usually a better investment.&nbsp;Check the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-eligibility\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing course eligibility<\/a>&nbsp;requirements before enrolling, though most courses are open to anyone regardless of educational background.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Learn from YouTube<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>YouTube is one of the most underrated learning platforms in the world. And for digital marketing specifically, there is an enormous amount of free content available from actual practitioners and educators.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can find video tutorials on every digital marketing topic imaginable, from how to set up a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Ads<\/a> campaign to how to write an SEO-optimized blog post. The best part is that it is all free.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is how to make the most of YouTube for learning:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Search for beginner-level content first before jumping to advanced topics&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow channels that&nbsp;regularly post&nbsp;updated content, since digital marketing changes fast&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Take notes while watching and try to implement what you learn&nbsp;immediately&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create playlists for different topics so you can learn in a structured way&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@wscubetech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WsCube&nbsp;Tech&#8217;s YouTube channel<\/a> is&nbsp;a great place&nbsp;to start, especially for Hindi-speaking learners who want to understand digital marketing concepts in a clear and&nbsp;simple way.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Learn from Digital Marketing Blogs<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Reading blogs is&nbsp;a great way&nbsp;to stay informed and learn at a deeper level. Many leading platforms in the digital marketing world publish detailed articles on every topic, and they keep updating their content as the industry evolves.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Some of the best digital marketing blogs to follow include:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/neilpatel.com\/blog\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Neil Patel\u2019s Blog<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;Covers SEO, content marketing, and online growth strategies in&nbsp;great detail&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/moz.com\/blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Moz Blog<\/a><\/strong>: One of the best resources for SEO news, guides, and research&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/blog.hubspot.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">HubSpot Blog<\/a>:&nbsp;<\/strong>Excellent for inbound marketing, email marketing, and CRM tips&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.searchenginejournal.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Search Engine Journal<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;Focused on search, SEO, and PPC with regular industry updates&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WsCube&nbsp;Tech Blog<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;Great for beginners who want step-by-step guides in simple language&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Blogs are also a great way to understand how SEO and content marketing actually work in practice.&nbsp;As you read well-written posts, you will naturally start to see how headings, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-keywords\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">keywords<\/a>, links, and structure come together.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Read Digital Marketing Books<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Books are still one of the best ways to build&nbsp;a strong foundation&nbsp;in any subject. Digital marketing is&nbsp;no&nbsp;different. While the industry moves fast, the core principles of marketing, consumer psychology, and persuasion remain relevant no matter how platforms change.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here are some widely recommended&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-books\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">books for aspiring digital marketers<\/a>:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.in\/Jab-Right-Hook\/dp\/006227306X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Jab, Jab, Jab, Right Hook by Gary Vaynerchuk<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;Teaches how to create content that resonates on social media&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.in\/They-Ask-You-Answer-Revolutionary\/dp\/1119312973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">They Ask, You Answer by Marcus Sheridan<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;A practical guide to content marketing and inbound sales&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/SEO-2025-optimization-marketing-strategies\/dp\/B0DMCCV4S2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">SEO 2025 by Adam Clarke<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;An updated guide to search engine optimization techniques&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.in\/PERMISSION-MARKETING-Seth-Godin\/dp\/0684856360\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Permission Marketing by Seth Godin<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;A classic that explains the shift from interruption marketing to earning attention&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.in\/Digital-Marketing-Dummies-Business-Personal\/dp\/1119235596\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Digital Marketing for Dummies by Ryan Deiss<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;A great all-around introduction for complete beginners&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Reading one or two books alongside your online learning can give you a much stronger theoretical base and help you think strategically, not just tactically.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Attend Webinars and Online Workshops<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Webinars and online workshops are live (or recorded) sessions hosted by digital marketing experts. They are&nbsp;a great way&nbsp;to learn from professionals in real time, ask questions, and get insights that you might not find in a regular course or blog post.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here&nbsp;is&nbsp;why webinars work well:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You get to hear from practitioners who are actively working in the field&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Live Q&amp;A sessions let you get answers to specific doubts&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Many webinars are free, especially those hosted by platforms promoting their tools&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>They are usually focused on specific topics, so you can pick exactly what you want to learn&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Look for webinars hosted by companies like Google, HubSpot, SEMrush,\u00a0Ahrefs, and Meta. Many of these are free and are conducted by professionals who actively use digital marketing every day.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Also,&nbsp;look&nbsp;for free workshops by training platforms like&nbsp;WsCube&nbsp;Tech, which regularly&nbsp;organizes&nbsp;sessions on topics like SEO, social media advertising, and content creation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-06e48efff4b609850ead2a0f8ee0a318\"><strong>Essential Topics Related to Digital Marketing<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/impact-of-ai-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Impact of AI in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/ai-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/career-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Career in Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/history-and-evolution-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Full History of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-syllabus\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course Syllabus<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-course-eligibility\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course Eligibility<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-salary-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Salary in India<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How Long to Learn Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-advantages-disadvantages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pros and Cons of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-platforms\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Digital Marketing Platforms<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Best Digital Marketing Tools<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/benefits-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Benefits<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/types-of-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Types of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/future-scope-of-digital-marketing-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Scope of Digital Marketing in India<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-trends\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Latest Digital Marketing Trends<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-channels\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Channels<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-future\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Future of Digital Marketing<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-terminologies\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Terminologies<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Stay Updated with Industry Trends<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Digital marketing changes constantly. An SEO strategy that worked in 2022 might not work as well today. A social media platform that was booming last year might have shifted in terms of reach and engagement. Staying updated is not&nbsp;just good&nbsp;practice;&nbsp;it is essential.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is how to keep up with what is happening in the world of digital marketing:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Subscribe to newsletters from platforms like Moz, HubSpot, Search Engine Land, and Marketing Brew\u00a0<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow industry leaders like Neil Patel, Rand Fishkin, and Ann Handley on social media&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Listen to digital marketing podcasts during commutes or downtime&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Join LinkedIn groups and Facebook communities where professionals share news and insights&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set up Google Alerts for keywords like &#8216;SEO updates&#8217;, &#8216;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-trends\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing trends<\/a>&#8216;, and similar terms&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Making it a habit to spend even 15 to 20 minutes per day reading industry news can make a significant difference in how current and relevant your knowledge stays.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Practice with Real Projects<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This is one of the most important steps that beginners often skip. Reading and watching videos will only take you so far.&nbsp;Real&nbsp;learning happens when you actually do things.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here are some practical ways to apply what you learn:<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Start a blog:&nbsp;<\/strong>Create a blog on a topic you enjoy and practice SEO, content writing, and analytics on it&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Run a test Google Ads campaign:<\/strong>&nbsp;Even a small budget of a few hundred rupees can teach you a lot about paid advertising&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Manage social media for a small business:<\/strong>&nbsp;Offer to help a local business or friend&#8217;s business with their social media for free to gain experience&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Create an email newsletter:&nbsp;<\/strong>Build a small email list and practice writing and sending campaigns using free tools like Mailchimp&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Optimize\u00a0a website:\u00a0<\/strong>Use free tools like Google Search Console and\u00a0Ubersuggest\u00a0to practice basic SEO\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Every project you work on, no matter how small, teaches you something that a video or book never could. And these projects also become part of your portfolio when you start applying for jobs or freelance work.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Join Digital Marketing Communities<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Learning alone can feel&nbsp;isolating&nbsp;at times. Joining a community of people who are also learning or already working in digital marketing can make the journey a lot more enjoyable and productive.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Communities help you in several ways:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You get answers to questions from people who have faced the same problems&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>You learn about tools, strategies, and opportunities that you might not discover on your own&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Networking with other professionals can lead to job referrals, collaborations, and freelance opportunities&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Look for active communities on Reddit (r\/digital_marketing\u00a0and r\/SEO), Facebook Groups, LinkedIn Groups, and Discord servers dedicated to digital marketing.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Get Certified for Free<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Certifications add credibility to your skills and can make your resume or LinkedIn profile stand out. The good news is that many of the most respected certifications in digital marketing are completely free.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Some certifications worth getting:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Google Analytics Certification:<\/strong>&nbsp;From Google&#8217;s&nbsp;Skillshop&nbsp;platform&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Google Ads Certification:<\/strong>&nbsp;Covers search, display, video, and shopping ads&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>HubSpot Content Marketing Certification:<\/strong>&nbsp;Highly respected in the inbound marketing space&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Meta Social Media Marketing Certificate:<\/strong>&nbsp;Covers Facebook and Instagram advertising&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>SEMrush SEO Toolkit Course:<\/strong>&nbsp;A solid introduction to professional <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-free-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO tools<\/a> and techniques&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Adding these to your profile shows potential employers and clients that you are serious about your learning and have a verified understanding of the tools and concepts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Follow Industry Experts on Social Media<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Social media is not just for entertainment. If you follow the right people, your feed can become a daily source of learning and inspiration.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Some digital marketing experts worth following:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Neil Patel:<\/strong>&nbsp;Digital marketing guru known for SEO, content, and growth strategies&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Gary Vaynerchuk:<\/strong>&nbsp;Known for social media marketing and entrepreneurship content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rand Fishkin:&nbsp;<\/strong>Co-founder of Moz, one of the most respected voices in SEO&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Ann Handley:<\/strong>&nbsp;Content marketing expert and bestselling author&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Brian Dean:<\/strong>&nbsp;Known for actionable SEO strategies and tutorials&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>When you see how these experts think, talk about their work, and break down complex strategies, you naturally start developing a sharper understanding of the field.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-d72f351059e80039135382f58233f821\"><strong>Explore Our Most Popular Marketing Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/performance-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogTable&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Performance Marketing Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/ai-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Best Way to Learn Digital Marketing at Home<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>If you want to know the&nbsp;best way to learn digital marketing at home, here is the honest answer:<\/strong> there is no single method that works for everyone. The best approach is a combination of structured learning, consistent practice, and staying updated.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is a simple learning roadmap you can follow:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Week 1 to 2:<\/strong>&nbsp;Start with a structured course or a YouTube playlist to understand the basics of digital marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Week 3 to 4:<\/strong>&nbsp;Pick one area to focus on first, such as SEO or social media marketing&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Month 2:<\/strong>&nbsp;Start practicing by working on a real project like a blog or a social media page&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Month 3:<\/strong>&nbsp;Get certified in at least one area and start building your portfolio&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Month 4 onwards:<\/strong>&nbsp;Start applying for jobs, internships, or freelance projects while continuing to learn&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Consistency matters more than speed. Even one to two hours of focused learning per day can lead to job-ready skills in three to six months.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home for Free?&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home for Free&nbsp;is one of the most searched questions on this topic, and the good news is that it is&nbsp;possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here are the best free resources you can use right now:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free.webp\" alt=\"How to Learn Digital Marketing at Home for Free?\" class=\"wp-image-20073\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home-for-free-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Google&nbsp;Skillshop:<\/strong>&nbsp;Free courses and certifications on Google Ads, Analytics, and more&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>HubSpot Academy:&nbsp;<\/strong>Free certifications on inbound marketing, email, and content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Meta Blueprint:&nbsp;<\/strong>Free training on Facebook and Instagram advertising&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>YouTube:&nbsp;<\/strong>Thousands of hours of free digital marketing tutorials&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Moz Beginner\u2019s Guide to SEO:<\/strong>&nbsp;One of the best free SEO resources available online&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Google Digital Garage:<\/strong>&nbsp;A free course on digital marketing fundamentals with a certificate from Google&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Combining two or three of these free resources with daily practice can give you&nbsp;a strong foundation&nbsp;without spending a single rupee.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/how-to-learn-digital-marketing-at-home\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"380\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program.webp\" alt=\"Digital marketing Course Banner\" class=\"wp-image-14519\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/digital-marketing-mentorship-program-1536x378.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs About Learning Digital Marketing at Home<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870793096\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. Can I learn digital marketing at home without any experience?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, absolutely. Digital marketing is one of those fields where you do not need any prior experience or a specific educational background. Most learning resources are designed for complete beginners. All you need is curiosity, consistency, and access to the internet. If you are\u00a0wondering,\u00a0can I\u00a0learn digital marketing at home, the\u00a0answer is yes, and you can start today.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870802883\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. How long does it take to learn digital marketing from home?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">It depends on how much time you put in each day and how deep you want to go. Most people can build a solid foundational understanding in two to three months with one to two hours of daily learning. Becoming truly proficient in a specific area like SEO or PPC usually takes six to twelve months of consistent learning and practice.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870817098\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. Do I need to spend money to learn digital marketing at home?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Not necessarily. There are excellent free resources available, including Google\u00a0Skillshop, HubSpot Academy, YouTube tutorials, and Moz&#8217;s SEO guide. However, if you want structured, comprehensive training with mentorship and placement support, investing in a\u00a0well-paid\u00a0course can save you a lot of time and give you better results\u00a0in the long run.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870832631\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. How can I practice digital marketing while learning?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The best way to practice is to start\u00a0doing it. Create a blog and practice SEO. Start a social media page and experiment with content. Run a small ad campaign with a minimal budget. These hands-on experiences will teach you far more than just reading or watching videos.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870844833\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. Is digital marketing a good career\u00a0option?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, and it is only getting better. With the global digital marketing market projected to reach over USD 1.2 trillion by 2034, the demand for skilled professionals is going to keep rising. Digital marketing offers roles like SEO specialist, social media manager, content marketer, PPC analyst, email marketer, and digital marketing manager, among many others.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1781870858365\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. How can I learn digital marketing for free at home?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">How to learn digital marketing at\u00a0home\u00a0free\u00a0is\u00a0a very common\u00a0question. The short answer is,\u00a0use\u00a0free platforms like Google\u00a0Skillshop, HubSpot Academy, Meta Blueprint, and YouTube. Supplement your learning with industry blogs, podcasts, and free communities. While free resources are great for building a foundation, a structured course can accelerate your learning significantly.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Final Thoughts&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Learning digital marketing from home is not just&nbsp;possible;&nbsp;it is one of the smartest things you can do for your career right now. The digital world is growing at an incredible pace, and businesses of all sizes need people who understand how to market online.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether you start with a free YouTube playlist, a certification from Google, or enroll in a structured online course, what matters most is that you start. Take it one day at a time, practice consistently, and do not be afraid to make mistakes. That is how real learning happens.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you are serious about building a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/career-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">career in digital marketing<\/a>, consider joining a comprehensive&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogMenu&amp;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nor